---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="workers-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="workers-heading">Your workers</h2>
    <p class="measure">
      Once you've added a worker's email, they sign in with Google, Microsoft or an emailed code. They
      see only their own jobs and time, and their pay, marked not final until you approve it. You pay
      them by the hour or as a share of the invoice, with time on site rounded to 15 minutes. There's no
      extra cost per worker.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
